{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321817001:1":{"text":"瓦丽卡女士，你匆忙来此，是出了什么事情？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡女士，你匆忙来此，是出了什么事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC75D9F87DFEC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321817002:2":{"text":"我察觉到了恶魔的魔法气息……看来这似乎并不是我的错觉。","source_cn":"我察觉到了恶魔的魔法气息……看来这似乎并不是我的错觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE1025A096A9D46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321817003:0":{"text":"怎么了，法拉莫尔先生，这样看着我。","source_cn":"怎么了，法拉莫尔先生，这样看着我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA4CB848CA4D9496","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321817004:0":{"text":"我……只是有些惊讶，您能在这么远的距离捕捉到气息。","source_cn":"我……只是有些惊讶，您能在这么远的距离捕捉到气息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x126EFC0CDADDAD73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321817005:1":{"text":"白山的亡灵是为了对抗恶魔才诞生的……只是时间太久，有些人在自己的使命中迷失了。","source_cn":"白山的亡灵是为了对抗恶魔才诞生的……只是时间太久，有些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB5A2CFB64D9F88A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_